// Port-only: the Vulkan renderer's draws of the HD frames that hold their blended pixels alone (MCVulkanRenderer's
// EffectDraw: an effect's, smoke, a PPC's bolt: KindHd, adding light). It is draw.pshader with the other kinds left out
// and the flags such a draw has fixed (draw.pshader's EffectKnown), so these pixels, the many of an explosion's stacked
// frames, don't pay for the paths they never take.

#define DRAW_VARIANT DRAW_EFFECT_KINDS
#include "draw.pshader"
